<fo:block><fo:float float="start"><fo:block-container width="100pt" height="60pt"><fo:block>Float</fo:block></fo:block-container></fo:float>The quick brown fox jumps over the lazy dog, and then it runs back across the field again before the evening comes.</fo:block><fo:block>Before <fo:inline>the run<fo:block linefeed-treatment="preserve">&#x2028;</fo:block>after the break</fo:inline> and on.</fo:block>
